    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/9a036514120b69cdee9654222bed7ab1.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test with focused missions: each challenge requires you to use 3 specific cards. Complete them to <strong>unlock exclusive new cards</strong> and <strong>earn dedicated achievements</strong>. Every challenge is a new strategic puzzle \u2014 and another chance to blow everything up!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disaster Blaster is a roguelite automation card game where you play a questionably sane scientist building the most over-the-top weapon in the universe. Design your blaster\u2019s shooting mechanism and let it rip against hordes of alien enemies across a galaxy of unfortunate planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features from Updates</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer mode</strong>  <br>Streamer Mode\u00a0(Beta) is a brand-new game mode that lets you <strong>connect Disaster Blaster directly to your stream</strong>, turning your audience into an active part of the chaos. Viewers can interact with the game through chat and other stream events, influencing gameplay in all sorts of unpredictable ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer Mode\u00a0(Beta) supports both <strong>Twitch </strong>and <strong>TikTok Live</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control over your build? The pin system lets you secure up to 3 key cards, increasing the chance they'll appear during your run. Perfect for setting up devastating combos right from the start!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your blaster...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add and swap cards in your weapon as their effects are applied in sequence to the next shot.\u00a0Boost the damage, increase shooting speed,  turn bullets into incendiary and bouncing projectiles! Make incredible combos and watch your creation evolve and transform into an indomitable force!       <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...Destroy everything else</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your weapon in a virtual conquest mission led by an alien who will face endless waves of enemies until the entire planet is destroyed. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover new planets and alien species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new planets and face quirky native alien species, each with unique abilities. Unlock them as new characters you can use to test your weapons in future runs, harnessing their powers for even more dynamic gameplay.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of new cards for your weapon and combine them with alien abilities to maximize your offensive potential and create crazy synergies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced and varied</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intense 10-minute matches with tons of customization possibilities. Each game is a different experience! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disaster Blaster is a roguelite automation card game where you play a questionably sane scientist building the most over-the-top weapon in the universe. Design your blaster\u2019s shooting mechanism and let it rip against hordes of alien enemies across a galaxy of unfortunate planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features from Updates</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer mode</strong>  <br>Streamer Mode\u00a0(Beta) is a brand-new game mode that lets you <strong>connect Disaster Blaster directly to your stream</strong>, turning your audience into an active part of the chaos. Viewers can interact with the game through chat and other stream events, influencing gameplay in all sorts of unpredictable ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer Mode\u00a0(Beta) supports both <strong>Twitch </strong>and <strong>TikTok Live</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control over your build? The pin system lets you secure up to 3 key cards, increasing the chance they'll appear during your run. Perfect for setting up devastating combos right from the start!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your blaster...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add and swap cards in your weapon as their effects are applied in sequence to the next shot.\u00a0Boost the damage, increase shooting speed,  turn bullets into incendiary and bouncing projectiles! Make incredible combos and watch your creation evolve and transform into an indomitable force!       <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/bdbb0244761711054b5e9688071f6f74.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...Destroy everything else</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your weapon in a virtual conquest mission led by an alien who will face endless waves of enemies until the entire planet is destroyed. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/5960a4eab8a2dd34f756716e31bfcd15.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover new planets and alien species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new planets and face quirky native alien species, each with unique abilities. Unlock them as new characters you can use to test your weapons in future runs, harnessing their powers for even more dynamic gameplay.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/ef54e08e6b83d6c7ae7f8fc650c2c914.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of new cards for your weapon and combine them with alien abilities to maximize your offensive potential and create crazy synergies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.poster.avif?t=1752588836\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.webm?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/241e4a9747546655df01c698d2e45879.mp4?t=1752588836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced and varied</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intense 10-minute matches with tons of customization possibilities. Each game is a different experience! </p>",
